      "explanation_markdown": "**Idea.** $\\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{b} = |\\vec{a}||\\vec{b}|\\cos\\theta$.\n\nFor perpendicular vectors $\\theta = 90^\\circ$ and $\\cos 90^\\circ = 0$, so the dot product is zero. The statement is **true**.",
